{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07368","headline":"题虎丘寺 · 刘长卿","name":"题虎丘寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青林虎丘寺，林际翠微路。\n仰见山僧来，遥从飞鸟处。\n兹峰沦宝玉，千载唯丘墓。\n埋劒人空传，凿山龙已去。\n扪萝披翳荟，路转夕阳遽。\n虎啸崖谷寒，猿鸣杉松暮。\n裴回北楼上，江海穷一顾。\n日映千里帆，鸦归万家树。\n蹔因惬所适，果得损外虑。\n庭暗栖闲云，檐香滴甘露。\n久迷空寂理，多爲繁华故。\n永欲投死生，余生岂能误。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07368.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07368","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}